        "description": "<p>Easily add the Venjue widget to your WordPress website with one-click installation. Customize and configure to your brand identity with ease.<br />\nSee more at https://venjue.com</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ul>\n<li>Install plugin</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin in WordPress <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Plugins <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Venjue Widget <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Activate</li>\n<li>Go to Settings <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Venjue Widget and configure the Venjue widget for your WordPress site</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Revamped Settings page with more customization options</li>\n<li>Added ability to configure Google Analytics via Google Tag Manager ID</li>\n<li>Added custom code injection that runs after the widget’s ready event</li>\n<li>Added “Auto” language option (follows site language, defaults to English)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
